* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_curex (reference/crafted.toml, 8 Nov 2026): currency
* conversion, preppm.mod L27-28 and curex.gms (M1.3 change 26, docs/m13-plan.md), which no
* public suite model reaches. TIMES_Demo demo12 (etsap-TIMES/TIMES_Demo @ 962db86, CC BY 4.0)
* plus three currencies besides MEuro05:
* - REG1 discounts in MEuro05 and MUSD (G_DRATE), so MUSD, with one rate to a discounted
*   currency, is converted to MEuro05 and leaves RDCUR (curex.gms L21-26); MGBP has rates to
*   both, so it is mapped nowhere in REG1 and its costs are dropped; MJPY reaches MEuro05
*   through MUSD (the chain of L29-32).
* - REG2 has its own MUSD rate (R_CUREX, kept by preppm.mod L27) and converts MGBP too.
* Costs in those currencies are added on top of demo12's MEuro05 costs of the same
* processes (ACT_COST, NCAP_FOM, FLO_DELIV: converted and summed per target, L81).
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
SET CUR
/
MUSD
MGBP
MJPY
/;

PARAMETER
G_DRATE ' '/
REG1.2005.MUSD 0.05
/

PARAMETER
G_CUREX ' '/
MUSD.MEuro05 0.9
MGBP.MEuro05 1.15
MGBP.MUSD 1.3
MJPY.MUSD 0.007
/

PARAMETER
R_CUREX ' '/
REG2.MUSD.MEuro05 0.8
/

PARAMETER
ACT_COST ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00.MUSD 0.2
REG2.2005.ELCTEGAS00.MUSD 0.5
REG1.2005.ELCREBIO00.MJPY 20
REG1.2005.ELCNENUC00.MGBP 9
/

PARAMETER
NCAP_FOM ' '/
REG2.2005.ELCTEGAS00.MGBP 10
REG1.2010.ELCNENUC00.MUSD 3
/

PARAMETER
FLO_DELIV ' '/
REG2.2005.ELCTEGAS00.ELCGAS.ANNUAL.MUSD 0.1
/
